  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#user-interacted is set to true in:\r\n\r\n * https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#common-input-element-events:user-interacted (`<input>`-specific).\r\n * https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#send-select-update-notifications (`<select>`-specific).\r\n * https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#focus-update-steps (`<input>`-specific).\r\n * https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#constructing-the-form-data-set (form submission)\r\n\r\nIt seems as an oversight?",
